LXX-Creative Torn-Paper Art Layout

This repository contains an independently written Codex workflow for tactile
torn-paper editorial photo layouts.

The visual direction was informed in part by the MIT-licensed project:
  Gathered Scenes Zine by Zeejay0
  https://github.com/Zeejay0/gathered-scenes-zine-skill

No source photographs, generated client images, or upstream prompt text are
included in this repository.
